# Copy to .env. Nothing here is required; the defaults in src/config.py work.

# Where profiles, ledger databases and archived statements live.
#
# The default is under ~/Library/Application Support rather than ~/Documents.
# On a Mac with iCloud "Desktop & Documents" enabled, Documents is synced: that
# uploads bank statements to iCloud, and a SQLite database synced while open
# can be corrupted. Choose a local folder on an encrypted disk.
# FINCH_HOME=~/Library/Application Support/finch
